docs {
  The signed-in user's library (owned games) and wishlist (wanted games). Entries are addressed by the game's
  BoardGameGeek ID. Run **Catalog → Get Game** first so `bggGameId` is in the local catalog.

  The requests below run as a round trip (add → list → update → remove), so the folder can be re-run.
}
